  "description": "G1 - Mixed Group - To raise low branches where necessary overhanging Reedham Drive to 5m high.\r510 - Sycamore - Remove basal growth, shorten lower overextended Westward branches by circa 2.5m in length, to a height of 9m.\rG2 - Wych Elm Group - To fell stems marked with orange spots.\r523 - Wych Elm - To remove adjacent spot marked, damaged stem.\r525 - Sycamore - To reduce crown height & spread by 3m.\r531 - Common Yew - To reduce crown height by 2.5m & spread by 2m.\r532 - Common Yew - To reduce crown height by 2.5m & spread by 2m.\r533a - Common Ash - To fell.\r(TPO 30 \u0016 47, 1979)",
